IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `nhba-heritage`

-- National Heritage Board Act 1993, ss 4, 5, 14, 15, 16(3), 46, 47, 47A, 48 and Schedule paras 7, 9, 11 -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or subsidiary legislation (none was retrieved).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_national-heritage-board-act-1993.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

